(   - Adverbial Clauses: Modify verbs, adjectives, or entire clauses, expressing relations of Time) Tj
T*
(   \(after, before\), Cause \(because, since\), Concession \(although, whereas\), Condition \(if,) Tj
T*
(   unless\), or Purpose \(so that, in order that\):) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "The cell lysate was kept on ice so that endogenous proteases would not degrade the) Tj
