(   3. Dash or Parenthesis Appositives for Complex Lists:) Tj
T*
(   When the appositive itself contains internal commas, enclose it with em-dashes \(or hyphens in) Tj
T*
(   ASCII\) or parentheses:) Tj
T*
(   - "Three major cell components - ribosomes, mRNA, and transfer RNA - participate in polypeptide) Tj
