(   - Many a / Many an: An archaic or formal distributive construction that is grammatically) Tj
T*
(   singular:) Tj
T*
(   - "Many a candidate compound has failed in preclinical pharmacokinetic trials.") Tj
T*
(   - More than one: Although semantically plural \(meaning two or more\), its grammatical head is) Tj
T*
(   'one', mandating a singular verb:) Tj
T*
(   - "More than one bacterial colony was discovered on the selective agar plate.") Tj
T*
(   - Contrast: "More than two bacterial colonies were discovered...") Tj
T*
() Tj
